           ccrreeaattee__ssiizzee           Create file size.
           ddiirreeccttoorryy__eennttrriieess     Directory entries.
           ddrriivvee__hheeaaddss           Drive heads.
           ffaatt__ttyyppee              FAT type (12, 16, or 32).
           ffllooppppyy                Preset drive parameters for standard format
                                 floppy disks (160, 180, 320, 360, 640, 720,
