           ooffffsseett                Offset in device.
           rreesseerrvveedd__sseeccttoorrss      Reserved sectors.
           sseeccttoorrss__ppeerr__cclluusstteerr   Sectors per cluster.
           sseeccttoorrss__ppeerr__ffaatt       Sectors per FAT.
           sseeccttoorrss__ppeerr__ttrraacckk     Sectors per track.
           ssiizzee                  File System size.
           vvoolluummee__iidd             Volume ID.
